lice_Unpack, then PySlice_AdjustIndices with"] [549 3 "// Py_SIZE): an __index__ may change the list"] [583 4 "// converting v may have changed the list too (list_ass_slice clamps to Py_SIZE again)"] [592 3 "// the extended slice's length after converting v, which may have changed the list (list_ass_subscript's"] [593 3 "// PySlice_AdjustIndices after PySequence_Fast, gh-120384; queue 203: test_list_index_modifing_operand)"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[52 25] [65 25] [77 24] [79 24] [94 23] [102 24] [105 23] [109 71] [115 24] [141 28] [164 28] [173 27] [179 23] [179 30] [201 6] [201 32] [242 12] [242 19] [278 16] [278 44] [328 51] [375 23] [376 27] [404 32] [414 48] [421 42] [428 49] [433 26] [547 25] [563 24] [563 31] [577 29] [594 58] [600 23] [600 30]]} (go/file "containers.go" :imports [

